# Byte-exact checkouts for provenance.
#
# Stage manifests (results/*/run_manifest.json, the Stage 04 coalition cache,
# results/stage07/verification.json and others) record SHA-256 hashes of the exact
# bytes of source, configuration, lock and result files as they were on disk when
# each stage ran. Those bytes mix LF and CRLF line endings, so any end-of-line
# conversion on checkout (core.autocrlf, eol) breaks the frozen provenance checks.
# Disabling the text attribute stores and restores every file byte for byte on
# any operating system and with any core.autocrlf setting. Diffs still work.
* -text
